     "titulo": "Allergies and intolerances",
     "texto": [
      "To report an allergy, «Ik ben allergisch voor...» (I am allergic to...) is used. Essential nouns are «pinda» (peanut) and «noten» (nuts in general). To check that a preparation is safe, the waiter is asked: «Kunt u dat controleren bij de kok?» (Can you check that with the chef?)."
     ],
